===Brazil vs Argentina===
{{see also|Argentina–Brazil football rivalry}}
{{external media|float= right|video1 ={{YouTube|O3DDJXfOBP8|Brazil v Argentina (Italy 1990) Full match}}}}

Brazil dominated for most of the match, but [[Diego Maradona]] went on a trademark run from the halfway line to the edge of the penalty area late in the match, and found [[Claudio Caniggia]], who rounded the onrushing [[Cláudio Taffarel]] to give Argentina a lead that they would not relinquish.

As of 2025, this is the last time Argentina played Brazil in a World Cup Tournament.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OvMBgOCebiI|title = 'Every match was like a final' &#124; Argentina at the 1990 World Cup|website = [[YouTube]]}}</ref>

